    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daūdi kūnekeja Saulo hangī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bana Zifu būja hangī ī Gibea ū kūlī Saulo; būūkang'wīla, “Ū Daūdi atibisile mu lūgūlū lwa Hakila ūlo lūlī bbihī na Yeshimoti?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Saulo ūsola ibità lya banhū shihūmbī shidatū, abo baalī basanyiwe ū mu sī ya Isilaeli; ūbūūka ajile nabo ū kwitogolo lya Zifu kūjūnkooba ū Daūdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo aho washika kū lūgūlū lwa Hakila ūbeeja ng'hambī ya kūlaala bbihī n'ikūūwa, kwilola na Yeshimoti; ū Daūdi ūbiza alīko ū ū kū masaka ga kwitogolo. Aho wabona gīkī ū Saulo wankūūbīja ko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūtūma banhū kūjūūdata; ūdeeba gīkī ng'hana ū Saulo alīho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Daūdi ūbūūka ūja ūko walī watūūla ng'hambī ū Saulo. Ūbona aho yalī ī ng'hambī ya ng'wa Saulo nū Abuneeli ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Neeli, ūyo walī ntaale wa mabità ga bashilikale. Ū Saulo ī ng'hambī yakwe yalī ha gatī na ha gatī, yūpīndīlījiwa nī libità ī lyose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Daūdi ūmūūja walīho Ahimeleki Ng'hītī, na Abishai nzunaye o ng'wa Yoabu ng'wana Seluya; ūbabūūja ūhaya, “Nani alīzunya tūlaaje dege ū kū ng'hambī ya ng'wa Saulo?” Ū Abishai ūhaya, “Nakūja nang'ho ū nene!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'hana ū Daūdi nū Abishai būja koi ī būjikū; būnsanga ū Saulo alī ū mu ng'hambī alaalile, nī lichimu lyakwe lyachimīkagwa hasī bbihī nū ntwe gwakwe. Ū Abuneeli na a bashilikale a bangī baalī balaalile būmpīndīlīja ū Saulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abishai ūng'wīla ū Daūdi, “Ī lelo lūūlū ū SEEBA wantūūlaga ū ng'wanishi wako mu makono gako. Nilekage namambe ichimu līmò dūhū; nīyo ī lyane līkūjūūlibīla na hasī; ndūhū natūūshokeela kabīlī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūnshokeja ūhaya, “Yaya ū kūnyagaja! Nani ūyo adūgije kūtūūla nkono gwakwe halī ng'witīīlwa maguta o ng'wa SEEBA ūleka kūbiza na shilingo?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ongeja kūhaya, “Nalīkwilahīlīla mu lina lya ng'wa SEEBA mpanga gīkī, ū SEEBA ng'wenekīlī h'ūyo akūntūla, nūūlū līkūshika ī likanza lyakwe ache, hamo akūjūchīla nūūlū kū būlūgū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū kūlī nene, ngilo gete ū kūntūūlīla nkono gwane ū ng'witīīlwa maguta o ng'wa SEEBA. Na lūūlū ū bebe shisolage dūhū ī shikolo īsho shilī bbihī nū ntwe gwakwe, ī lichimu nī shisaabo sha minzī, tūje.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūbiza washisola ī shikolo īsho shalī bbihī nū ntwe go ng'wa Saulo, ī lichimu na a minzī; bīnga ho. Ū Saulo na a banhū bakwe baalī balaalile pye, nguno ū SEEBA walī wabitīīla tūlo nhaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ū Daūdi ūkīla kū ntambūko, ūja ūūkīmīīla ha ngūlya ka kūle, gūbiza ho ng'wanya ngalī a ha gatī yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūhīlīka ū kwibità; nū Abuneeli ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Neeli ūng'hamukīla alīng'wīla, “Abuneeli nibūlī ūtūnishokejaga mhayo.” Ū Abuneeli ūshosha alīhaya, “Ūlī nani ū bebe ūlīnyogeela ntemi gīko?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūshosha, “Bebe tūhaya ūlī ngosha apandile hasī a hene! Nani ūngī ū mu Isilaeli ūyo adūgije kūlenganījiwa na bebe? Hama nibūlī lūūlū walekaga ū kūnang'hana ū so būgonzo ū ntemi? Nguno munhū walī wizaga kūmūlaga ū so būgonzo ū ntemi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo ūyo wagwītaga gwenūyo gwabūbi no. Nalīkwilahīlīla mu lina lya ng'wa SEEBA mpanga gīkī ū bebe na a banhū bako shing'wigeleelilwe kūcha, nguno mutanang'hanile ū sīng'we būgonzo ū ng'witīīlwa maguta o ng'wa SEEBA. Aliilalangījage aho ūlī henaho, līlī halī ī lichimu lya ntemi īlo lyalī līchimīkile hasī bbihī na ntwe gwakwe, nī shisaabo sha minzī?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Saulo Kūnīlīīla Daūdi Anekeje",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo ūliitegeleja ī lilaka lya ng'wa Daūdi; ūhaya, “Ī lyenīlo ilaka lyako ng'wana wane Daūdi?” Ū Daūdi ūshosha alīhaya, “Lyane ng'hana baba ntemi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ongeja kūhaya, “Ū baba būgonzo nibūlī shi ī gete akūnkūūbīlījaga ū ntūmami wakwe? Naakenije kī? Ū būhūbi wane būlī mu mhayo kī? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū baba būgonzo ū ntemi ni ayīdegelekage ī mihayo ya ntūmami wakwe. Gīkī, ūlū abize SEEBA ūyo wakwenhelegije ūnūūbūkīle, nalīnomba anukūle shitambò. Alīyo ūlū babize banhū dūhū abo baagwītile ū mhayo gwenūyū, ni bazumagwe kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA! Nguno balīnipeeja nīnge; nawīngīle ū wingīji wane ū mulī SEEBA. Baanipeegije bakūhayaga gīkī, ‘Jaga kū bamulungu bangī ūkabatūmamīle.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, ūtizūgenheleja a mininga gane gidīke hasī aho natī kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA. Nguno ū ntemi wa Isilaeli wafumile hanze kūja akūkoobaga ka būda, gītī munhū akūhwīmaga ng'hwale mu ngūlū!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho ū Saulo ūhaya, “Daūdi ng'wana wane, nalī ng'hūbi ū nene; shokaga nooyaga lūūlū ū kūgema kūkwītīla yabūbi. Nguno ū bebe wabūbonaga ī lelo ū būpanga wane gīkī būlī na mpango ntaale. Alīyo ū nene īyo nakūkwītīlaga ū bebe ya nyachilū, nalī nkenaagūji ha taale no!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Daūdi ūhaya, “Līīlī lūūlū aha ī lichimu lya ntemi, ni wizage ūmò wa bayanda bako alīsole. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ng'wene akabanong'haga a banhū būlī ng'wene kūlenganīla na būtūngīlīja na wishigwa wakwe. Ī lelo ū SEEBA walī wakūtūūlaga mu makono gane, alīyo natagemile ū kūkūtūūlīla nkono gwane ū bebe ng'witīīlwa maguta o ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ūmo naalī nawisaabīla ū būpanga wako ī lelo gīkī būlī wa mpango ntaale, nalīnomba ū SEEBA awisaabe nū būpanga wane kūbiza wa mpango, hama anipīje kūfuma mu makoye gose.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo ūhaya, “Wīlūkīlwe ng'wana wane Daūdi; nīyo ūkwīta mihayo mitaale no, hama ūkūbiza mpyeni ū muyo.” Hūna ū Daūdi wīnga ho ūja; ū Saulo nang'hwe ūshoka kaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
